{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30846","headline":"送韩校书江西从事 · 马戴","name":"送韩校书江西从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出关寒色尽，云梦草生新。\n鴈背岳阳雨，客行江上春。\n遥程随水阔，枉路倒帆频。\n夕照临孤馆，朝霞发广津。\n湖山潮半隔，郡壁岸斜邻。\n自此锺陵道，裁书有故人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}